<title>USA: TNP Enterprises withdraws Choice proposal.</title>
<headline>TNP Enterprises withdraws Choice proposal.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TNP Enterprises Inc's wholly owned subsidiary Texas-New Mexico Power Company said on Wednesday it withdrew a previously announced plan to provide its customers with a choice of energy providers.</p>
</text>
